            "verifiedAt": "2026-11-03T04:47:03.882450+00:00",
            "quote": "Shall the City of Pflugerville City\nCharter be amended to authorize\nmonthly compensation for members\nof the City Council in the amount of\nseven hundred fifty dollars\n($750.00) per month for the Mayor\nand five hundred dollars ($500.00)\nper month for Council Members?"
