            "verifiedAt": "2026-11-03T04:47:03.882450+00:00",
            "quote": "Shall the City of Pflugerville City\nCharter be amended to lower, from\nfifteen percent (15%) to ten percent\n(10%), the percentage of qualified\nvoters required to sign a petition for\nan initiative, referendum, or\nnonbinding referendum?"
