            "quote": "THIS IS A TAX INCREASE.\nRatifying the ad valorem tax rate of\n$1.0328 per $100 valuation in Del\nValle Independent School District\nfor the current year, a rate that will\nresult in an increase of 19.5%\npercent in maintenance and\noperations tax revenue for the\nDistrict for the current year as\ncompared to the preceding year,\nwhich is an additional $20,038,349."
