          "questionText": "THIS IS A TAX INCREASE.\nRatifying the Ad Valorem tax rate of\n$1.192200 in Coupland\nIndependent School District for the\ncurrent year, a rate that will result in\nan increase of 4.14% percent in\nMaintenance and Operations tax\nrevenue for the district for the\ncurrent year as compared to the\npreceding year, which is an\nadditional $86,933.",
